{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100741","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100741/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100741/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100741/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100741","id":2754661395,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6GA6hJ","number":100741,"title":"Move non-const iteration from `Vector` to `Vector.write`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-12-22T13:30:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100741","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100741.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100741.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This allows owners of non-const `Vector` to const-iterate it, avoiding an accidental fork, which would be inefficient.\r\n\r\nTo re-iterate (no pun intended): It was previously _impossible_ to iterate a `Vector` without risking a copy if you had a non-const reference to it. Take the following example:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n// Non-const function\r\nvoid Something::do_something() {\r\n    for (const A &a : vector) {\r\n         print_line(a);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nEven though `a` is declared `const`, the functions called by the iteration were non-const `begin` and `end`, because c++ doesn't have reverse type inference and is forced to call the function that better matches the type of `vector`, which is non-const `Vector<a>`. \r\n\r\nIt is difficult to measure how many unnecessary forks were created during a normal run because of this detail, so I'm not going to do it. But it's likely at least some forks are avoided due to this change.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100741/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":8},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100741/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}